cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "leo_eclipse: eclipse duration and beta angle for circular low Earth orbits"
abstract: >-
  A single self-contained Python script that computes the beta angle and the
  eclipse duration of a circular low Earth orbit, in closed form and by direct
  geometric sampling of the Earth shadow, including the secular J2 regression
  of the node. Validated against NASA GMAT R2025a.
type: software
authors:
